// Time to submit, for submitted ordinary first / subsequent reviews with a captured start: hours from the first
// start of that piece of work (row of GloCo_CaseReview_Activity) to its first submission. A second review on
// the same case is its own piece of work, so it is never timed from the first review's start.
// ReviewType is "First" / "Subsequent" for GloCo_CaseReview_Duration_Chart.
GloCo_CaseReview_Activity
| where SubType in ("First review", "Subsequent review") and Status == "Submitted" and isnotnull(StartedAt)
| extend ReviewType = iif(SubType == "First review", "First", "Subsequent"),
         HoursDiff = round(datetime_diff("minute", SubmittedAt, StartedAt) / 60.0, 1)
| where HoursDiff > 0
| project CaseId, ReviewType, StartTime = StartedAt, SubmittedTime = SubmittedAt, HoursDiff, User_Email, User_AreaOrCPSD
